    {
      "handle": "nightengalejr.bsky.social",
      "author": "Bobby Nightengale",
      "team": "ツインズ",
      "outlet": "Star Tribune",
      "text": "Big loss for the Twins: Longtime TV field reporter Audra Martin didn’t have her contract renewed for next season. She always came up with great stories and brought a fun energy to the ballpark every day. www.startribune.com/minnesota-tw...",
      "likes": 31,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 4,
      "at": "2026-11-19T21:54:18.368Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:gtt6sqfv2lck4wxdxymmhrxk/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2p2ppoiyk2g",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Booooooo!",
          "likes": 3,
          "author": "brentdz.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Oh wow, that is a surprise and a bummer.",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "drewcorb.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Terrible decision",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "jimpeet.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "I call bullshit on this. Two days of great Twins news followed by this crappy announcement.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "bigrookie.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "ツインズに痛手。長年フィールドリポーターを務めたAudra Martinが、来季の契約を更新されなかった。いつも素晴らしい話を引き出し、毎日球場を明るくしてくれた。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "adammccalvy.bsky.social",
      "author": "Adam McCalvy",
      "team": "ブルワーズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "The documentary \"Ueck\" is out on DVD today at retailers around Wisconsin. To celebrate, there's a screening tonight at 7:30 p.m. CT at The New Fashioned in Milwaukee’s Deer District, with the directors in attendance for a post-screening Q&A.",
      "likes": 19,
      "reposts": 6,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-20T16:54:04.933Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:idooavtb3a4mlluqclqzel5p/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2r2fs7jec23",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ドキュメンタリー「Ueck」が本日DVD発売、ウィスコンシン州内の店で購入可能。記念上映会が今夜中部時間19時30分からミルウォーキーのThe New Fashionedで開催、監督も来場し上映後にQ&Aあり。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "nightengalejr.bsky.social",
      "author": "Bobby Nightengale",
      "team": "ツインズ",
      "outlet": "Star Tribune",
      "text": "Sonny Gray: “No way I’d come back to Minnesota if I didn’t think we could win.” Gray had a lot of conversations with GM Jeremy Zoll before he signed his $55M deal. He was assured the Twins will continue to add to their roster this offseason.",
      "likes": 33,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-19T17:15:39.218Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:gtt6sqfv2lck4wxdxymmhrxk/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2ol5h2k322q",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "Sonny Gray「勝てると思えなければミネソタには戻らなかった」。5500万ドルの契約前にGMのJeremy Zollと何度も話し合い、今オフもツインズが戦力を補強し続けると確約されたという。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "The Orioles announce they’ve avoided arbitration with right-hander Félix Bautista by agreeing to a one-year deal. That deal is worth $2.35 million, per source",
      "likes": 22,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-20T18:49:04.985Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2ratglnxc22",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "オリオールズが右腕Félix Bautistaと1年契約で合意し、年俸調停を回避。関係者によると契約額は235万ドル。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "In addition, the Orioles announce that righty Carter Baumler was returned by the Texas Rangers. Baumler was a 2025 Rule 5 pick. Baumler has been assigned to Triple-A",
      "likes": 16,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-19T19:02:54.930Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2or5ams5c2i",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "さらにオリオールズは、右腕Carter Baumlerがレンジャーズから戻されたと発表。2025年のRule 5ドラフト指名選手で、3Aに配属された。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "chandlerrome.bsky.social",
      "author": "Chandler Rome",
      "team": "アストロズ",
      "outlet": "The Athletic",
      "text": "Having both a manager and bench coach with catching backgrounds doesn’t seem like an accident for the Astros, who have some real decisions to make at the position this winter - www.nytimes.com/athletic/779...",
      "likes": 12,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-20T13:57:09.371Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:hqnn3kfpfuhkhv2b4izkrzpa/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2qqjgfl522g",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "監督もベンチコーチも捕手出身というのは、アストロズにとって偶然ではなさそうだ。この冬は捕手のポジションで大きな決断が待っている。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "chandlerrome.bsky.social",
      "author": "Chandler Rome",
      "team": "アストロズ",
      "outlet": "The Athletic",
      "text": "The Astros are hiring Bobby Wilson as bench coach on Brad Ausmus' staff, sources tell @ken-rosenthal.bsky.social and me. Wilson, who caught for parts of 10 seasons in the big leagues, spent last season as Nationals catching coach and run game coordinator - www.nytimes.com/athletic/779...",
      "likes": 12,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-19T18:35:29.429Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:hqnn3kfpfuhkhv2b4izkrzpa/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2opm7e4kc7l",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "アストロズがBrad Ausmus監督のスタッフにBobby Wilsonをベンチコーチとして迎える、と関係者が明かした。メジャーで10シーズンにわたり捕手を務め、昨季はナショナルズで捕手コーチ兼ランニングゲーム・コーディネーターだった。"
    },
    {
